{
  "title": "Heterogeneous Network Simulation for Return-Visit-Aware FANET Routing",
  "description": "A modular simulation environment for autonomous flying ad hoc networks (FANETs) with pluggable routing algorithms and support for both simulated and real-world UAV hardware. This framework supports heterogeneous UAV networks, real drone integration (DJI Tello, CoDrone), and provides a graphical user interface for simulation control.",
